1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,725
It all started this morning. I was just harvesting
my carrots... a totally normal morning...

2
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,045
When I heard this.

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:11,725
I walked into the forest, and then I saw it.

4
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:16,918
A portal! Big, purple, and it was just... pulling me in.
Like it knew I was coming.

5
00:00:16,918 --> 00:00:21,505
Would you dare go inside?
Type 'YES' in the comments if you're as brave as me!

